      16#48#, 16#EF#, 16#D4#, 16#18#, 16#6E#, 16#4B#, 16#D2#, 16#A9#, 16#98#, 16#B8#, 16#8E#, 16#4E#,
      16#EB#, 16#F5#, 16#F0#, 16#61#, 16#8E#, 16#62#, 16#BD#, 16#7E#, 16#45#, 16#92#, 16#8A#, 16#59#,
